#: includes/settings.php:656
msgid "When enabled, subscribers will not see the admin bar. Combine this with the <code>[dv_user_profile]</code> shortcode to create a page where users can edit their profile (name, email, password, organization) without accessing wp-admin. This creates a complete self-service portal experience for your users."
